{"notes":["SECURITY REVIEW — spk:local-deploy-ssh-transport (worktree feat/spk-local-deploy-ssh-transport) — Verdict: changes-requested for prod promotion (spike harness PASS for AC3, prod gap HIGH). Scope: SSH auth via ssh-agent/key-path from anvil.yaml, secret handling, scp atomic, checksum, threat model.","AC Verdict: AC1 PASS (histogram.csv 50/50 p95=500ms \u003c30s), AC2 PASS spike (atomic tmp+rename + checksumsMatch=true) but FAIL prod (non-atomic scp), AC3 PASS spike (RedactSecrets/SanitizeLogLine + TestRedactSecrets_NoKeyPathLeak green) CONDITIONAL prod, AC4 PASS (FailureClassification auth_fail/timeout/partial_write).","Evidence checked: simulated_transport.go (Push 60, RedactSecrets 168, SanitizeLogLine 185), harness.go (RunRetryTest 113, checksum verify), harness_test.go (TestRedactSecrets_NoKeyPathLeak 165, TestArtifactManifestCompliance 186), verify.go, histogram.go, internal/deployment/ssh_transport.go (loadSigner 293, dial 308, hostKeyCallback 333, scpUpload 595), ssh_credentials.go (ReadSSHCredentialsFromEnv 125), evidence histogram.csv/retry.log/checksum_verify.log.","[HIGH H-01] Prod scpUpload tidak atomic — spike pakai \u003cdst\u003e.tmp.\u003crand\u003e + fsync + rename (AC2 terbukti), prod pakai `scp -t \u003cremotePath\u003e` langsung (ssh_transport.go:608). Disconnect mid-transfer tinggalkan truncated file di final path, retry tidak idempotent. Impact: partial artifact bisa ter-activate, violate verification-before-trust. Mitigasi: upload ke tmp lalu mv atomically + verify checksum sebelum rename. OWASP A08. Blocking.","[HIGH H-02] Host key verification default InsecureIgnoreHostKey (ssh_transport.go:336) bila KnownHostsPath==\"\" — MITM risk. Spike simulated bypass total. Doc TD-004 legacy tapi anvil.yaml proposal tanpa enforcement. Impact: artifact hijack. Mitigasi: prod wajibkan DEPLOY_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS strict, fail-closed untuk prod target, accept-new hanya dev. OWASP A02/A05. Blocking.","[MEDIUM M-01] Prod error leak KeyPath full (ssh_transport.go:296/300 `cannot read/parse SSH private key file %q`) — TransportError.Reason ke CLI tanpa RedactSecrets. Spike redaction tidak dipakai di deployment package. Impact: /home/user/.ssh/id_ed25519 bocor ke log, AC3 gap. Mitigasi: redact ke basename/***REDACTED_PATH***, wrap logger dengan SanitizeLogLine, test loadSigner error redaction. OWASP A09. Blocking untuk AC3 prod.","[MEDIUM M-02] No transfer timeout — Timeout (10s) hanya bound dial (ssh_transport.go:312), scpUpload io.Copy tanpa context/deadline. Simulated cap 100ms tapi real hang indefinite. Impact: DoS hang, retry storm. Mitigasi: context.WithTimeout untuk Deliver keseluruhan + session deadline. OWASP Availability. Non-blocking tapi high priority.","[MEDIUM M-03] Redaction incomplete untuk raw PEM blob — RedactSecrets cek private/begin open/deploy_ssh_key tapi tidak cover BEGIN RSA/EC PRIVATE KEY dan base64 blob tanpa marker; SanitizeLogLine hanya id_rsa/id_ed25519/.pem. Jika DEPLOY_SSH_KEY salah di-set sebagai content bukan path, leak. Var name ambigu (DEPLOY_SSH_KEY = path). Mitigasi: regex BEGIN.*PRIVATE KEY, validasi ReadSSHCredentialsFromEnv reject jika value mengandung -----BEGIN, doc path-only. Tambah test PEM.","[LOW L-01] Missing key file permission check — os.ReadFile tanpa cek mode 0600/0400 (ssh_transport.go:294). Impact: key world-readable. Mitigasi: stat mode \u0026 warn/fail bila \u0026077 !=0.","[LOW L-02] Orphan tmp files — simulated tinggalkan .tmp.\u003crand\u003e sengaja (simulated_transport.go:112) tanpa cleanup. Jika prod adopt tmp+rename perlu stale cleanup. Impact: disk fill /tmp/anvil-uploads. Mitigasi: cleanup *.tmp.* on retry + cron/quota.","[INFO I-01] POSITIVE: checksum \u0026 manifest integrity strong — artifact.Package identity-from-content, VerifyChecksum via artifact.VerifyArtifact + manifest checksum, TestArtifactManifestCompliance PASS, retry.log checksumsMatch true, crypto/rand incompressible payload realistic. Pertahankan gate sebelum Activate.","Threat model: auth_fail correctly non-recoverable (KindAuthenticationFailed) tapi log perlu redacted; partial_write atomically safe di spike, vulnerable prod (H-01); timeout classified recoverable tapi tidak enforced (M-02); tampering mitigated via checksum.","Rekomendasi: Spike boleh close sebagai evidence (spike scope AC3 PASS), tapi JANGAN promote ke req/adr tanpa fix H-01 \u0026 H-02 (blocking). Port RedactSecrets/SanitizeLogLine ke internal/deployment, tambah e2e real SSH test (sshTestServer kill mid-transfer + atomic verify). Escalate ke primary (Alex Security) karena 2 HIGH blocking.","Next: Fix H-01 atomic rename, H-02 known_hosts enforcement, M-01 redaction, M-02 timeout, M-03 PEM regex. Re-run go test ./spikes/... -v + go vet + manual SanitizeLogLine check."],"role":"review","verdict":"changes-requested"}